OL,3,GNEWSAMonths of work on A52 roundabouts
OL,4,Aconfirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to upgrade two junctions on the
OL,7,FA52 in Nottinghamshire is set to begin
OL,8,Fnext month.
OL,10,FFrom 7 September, utilities and
OL,11,Ftelecoms companies will start to divert
OL,12,Ftheir infrastructure at the Wheatcroft
OL,13,Fand Nottingham Knight junctions ahead
OL,14,Fof National Highways beginning a major
OL,15,Fredesign.
OL,17,FThe preliminary phase will run into
OL,18,Fearly next year and will involve
OL,19,Fovernight closures, lane restrictions
OL,20,Fand a 40mph speed limit.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
