OL,3,GNEWSAMonths of work on A52 roundabouts
OL,4,Aconfirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main scheme, which will see the
OL,7,Froundabouts' layouts changed with a
OL,8,Fcut-through installed in the middle of
OL,9,Fthe islands connecting the A52, is due
OL,10,Fto begin in early 2027 and last until
OL,11,Fspring 2029.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
